    ~ sposob_na_odmienca = chrzest_odmienca
    # tlo: chrzest
    Jaromir harnessed the horse and raced to Bukowiec. The priest hesitated a long while, but at last he took the swaddled child and poured holy water over it.
    The changeling howled. In the priest’s arms there remained only a few rags and a piece of birch log with a carved face. # pokaz: kloda
    All night they searched for Marysia with lanterns – in the rushes, on the marshes, under every bush along the water – but found nothing. When the grandmother heard what they had done, she went pale.
    “You’ve killed their child,” she whispered. “Now you’ll not take her back by force. You must go to the lake and bargain with them.” # dalej
    -> nad_jeziorem_mamun
