# tlo: baza_wrzesien
{ uklad_z_mamunami == oddany_skarb:
    On Sunday Jaromir went to the old elder and opened the treasure chest in the den. It was empty. For a long time he held it in his hands, thinking of what lay now at the bottom of the lake. Then he put it back in its place. Marysia would have to find treasures of her own. # pokaz: pusta # dalej
    -> jesien_z_marysia
}
On Sunday, when the cottage had grown calm again, Jaromir went to the edge of the meadow, to the old elder. The den in its crown was nearly a ruin by now, but the treasure chest was still wedged under the loose board where they had hidden it as children. The ladder creaked under his weight, and up among the branches it smelled exactly as it had when he was eight. At the bottom, under a rotted burdock leaf, lay {skarb_jaromira == muszelka:a milk-white piece of shell from the lake|{skarb_jaromira == pioro:the jay’s feather, still blue as the sky after a storm|the rusty nail from a knight’s armour – or so it had once seemed}}. # pokaz: skrzynka
